<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/glossary#gabunga">Glossary</a> · Term · title</p><h1 class="enc-title">Gabunga</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Gabunga was the title of the admiral of the Kingdom of Buganda's fleet of war canoes on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lake-victoria">Lake Victoria</a>, a hereditary office held by the head of the Lungfish (Mamba) clan. The large plank-built canoes under his command let the kabakas raid and control the shores and islands of the lake, including the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sese-islands">Sese Islands</a> and Busoga, and carry trade and envoys across it.</p></div>
